---
import { COMPANY_INFO } from '../data/stores';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-[#14171A] text-slate-400 text-xs border-t border-neutral-800">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10">
      
      <!-- Brand Info -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-4">
        <a href="#inicio" class="inline-block hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
          <img 
            src="/images/logo-white.webp" 
            alt="Mat-Tek Máquinas e Motores" 
            width="200" 
            height="54" 
            class="h-12 w-auto object-contain"
          />
        </a>
        <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-xs">
          Venda, manutenção e assistência técnica autorizada em motores, geradores, máquinas e ferramentas. Atendendo Canguçu, Pelotas e toda a região sul desde 2017.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-1">
          <a
            href={COMPANY_INFO.instagram}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-neutral-800 hover:bg-neutral-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"
            aria-label="Instagram Pelotas"
            title="Instagram Pelotas"
          >
            <Icon name="instagram" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://www.instagram.com/mattekcangucu/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-neutral-800 hover:bg-neutral-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"
            aria-label="Instagram Canguçu"
            title="Instagram Canguçu"
          >
            <Icon name="instagram" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
          <a
            href={`https://wa.me/${COMPANY_INFO.centralWhatsappRaw}`}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-neutral-800 hover:bg-emerald-800/60 text-slate-300 hover:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"
            aria-label="WhatsApp Mat-Tek"
            title="WhatsApp Oficial"
          >
            <Icon name="messageCircle" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">Navegação</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>
            <a href="#inicio" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Início</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#parceiros" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Marcas Parceiras</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#historia" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Nossa História</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#unidades" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Lojas & Horários</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#contato" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Fale Conosco</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Store Pelotas -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">Unidade Pelotas</h4>
        <div class="space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <Icon name="mapPin" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#E31B23] shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>R. Gen. Argolo, 1322 - Centro, Pelotas - RS</span>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="phone" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#E31B23] shrink-0" />
            <a href="tel:555332285826" class="hover:text-white font-mono">(53) 3228-5826</a>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="messageCircle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0" />
            <a href="https://wa.me/5553984489179" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 font-mono hover:underline">
              (53) 98448-9179
            </a>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
            <Icon name="clock" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>Seg a Sex: 08:30–12:00, 13:30–18:00 (Sáb/Dom fechado)</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Store Canguçu -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">Unidade Canguçu (Matriz)</h4>
        <div class="space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <Icon name="mapPin" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#E31B23] shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>R. Gen. Câmara, 1556 - Centro, Canguçu - RS</span>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="phone" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#E31B23] shrink-0" />
            <a href="tel:5553999059179" class="hover:text-white font-mono">(53) 99905-9179</a>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="messageCircle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0" />
            <a href="https://wa.me/5553984489179" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 font-mono hover:underline">
              (53) 98448-9179
            </a>
          </p>
          <p class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
            <Icon name="clock" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>Seg a Sex: 08:30–12:00, 13:30–18:00 (Sáb/Dom fechado)</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom bar -->
    <div class="border-t border-neutral-800/80 mt-10 pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
      <p>© {currentYear} Mat-Tek Máquinas, Motores e Assistência Técnica. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
      <p class="flex items-center gap-1 text-slate-400">
        <span>Construindo nossa história com trabalho, honestidade e dedicação desde 2017.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
